{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_87_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_87","textTraditional":"一、二十有四年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_87_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_87","textTraditional":"二、夏，狄伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_87_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_87","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_87_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_87","textTraditional":"四、冬，天王出居於鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_87_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_87","textTraditional":"天子無出，出，失天下也。居者，居其所也。雖失天下，莫敢有也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_87_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_87","textTraditional":"五、晉侯夷吾卒。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}